 and Mathare.</p>\n<h2>Courier delivery to all 47 counties</h2>\n<p><strong>Nairobi region:</strong> Nairobi (by rider)</p>\n<p><strong>Central:</strong> Kiambu (Thika, Ruiru, Kikuyu, Limuru), Kirinyaga (Kerugoya, Kutus), Murang'a, Nyandarua (Ol Kalou), Nyeri (Nyeri, Karatina)</p>\n<p><strong>Coast:</strong> Mombasa, Kwale (Ukunda, Diani), Kilifi (Malindi, Kilifi), Tana River (Hola), Lamu, Taita-Taveta (Voi, Taveta)</p>\n<p><strong>Eastern:</strong> Marsabit, Isiolo, Meru, Tharaka-Nithi (Chuka), Embu, Kitui, Machakos (Machakos, Athi River), Makueni (Wote, Kibwezi)</p>\n<p><strong>North Eastern:</strong> Garissa, Wajir, Mandera</p>\n<p><strong>Nyanza:</strong> Kisumu, Siaya, Homa Bay, Migori, Kisii, Nyamira</p>\n<p><strong>Rift Valley:</strong> Turkana (Lodwar), West Pokot (Kapenguria), Samburu (Maralal), Trans Nzoia (Kitale), Uasin Gishu (Eldoret), Elgeyo-Marakwet (Iten), Nandi (Kapsabet), Baringo (Kabarnet), Laikipia (Nanyuki), Nakuru (Nakuru, Naivasha), Narok, Kajiado (Kitengela, Ngong, Ongata Rongai), Kericho, Bomet</p>\n<p><strong>Western:</strong> Kakamega, Vihiga, Bungoma, Busia</p>\n<p>Don't see your town? Message us on WhatsApp on <a href=\"https://wa.me/254717040531\">0717 040 531</a> and we'll tell you how we can get your order to you.</p>\n<h2>Questions</h2>\n<p><strong>Do you deliver outside Nairobi?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. We deliver to all 47 counties in Kenya by courier.</p>\n<p><strong>Do you deliver within Nairobi?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. Our own riders deliver anywhere in Nairobi County.</p>\n<p><strong>How much does delivery cost?</strong></p>\n<p>The cost for your location is shown at checkout before you pay.</p>\n<p><strong>How long does delivery take?</strong></p>\n<p>It depends on your location. Chat with us on WhatsApp on <a href=\"https://wa.me/254717040531\">0717 040 531</a> for the delivery time to your area.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I collect my order from your shop?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes, for free. We're at Techmart Iconic Business Plaza, 3rd Floor, Room T12, Moi Avenue, Nairobi CBD.</p>\n<p><strong>Can I see the product before I buy?</strong></p>\n<p>Yes. Visit the shop and our team will show you.</p>"}};

